Description: Contains four main functions (i.e., four pieces of furniture), 
    including table1() which produces a well-formatted table of descriptive 
    statistics common as Table 1 in research articles, tableC() which 
    produces a well-formatted table of correlations, tableF() which provides 
    frequency counts, and washer() which is helpful in cleaning up the data. 
    These furniture-themed functions are designed to simplify common tasks 
    in quantitative analysis. Other data summary and cleaning tools
    are also available.
